A contractor hit the inlet line at the Bulrush Bend meter station about twenty minutes ago. The station is shut in and nobody is hurt. I need gas control to reroute the noon nominations now, and I need one of you to call me within the hour to approve an emergency repair crew. My cell is 713-555-0142.

Halvard"}}

